<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h2>👋 {{ signature.name }}</h2>
<p>
  Thank you for signing <a href="{{env.WEBSITE_URL}}/{{letter.slug}}">{{letter.title}}</a>. To confirm your signature, click the button below.
</p>

<p>
  <center>
    <a href="{{env.WEBSITE_URL}}/{{letter.slug}}/confirm_signature?token={{signature.token}}" style="text-decoration: none;display:inline-block;width:220px;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background: #111; color: white; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px; box-sizing: border-box;">
      Confirm Signature
    </a>
  </center>
</p>

<h3>About your privacy 🔏</h3>
<p>
  We take your privacy seriously. There are no cookies or trackers on the signing page. We don't keep your email address unless you explicitly opted in to receive updates about this statement.
  Read our <a href="{{env.PRIVACY_URL}}">privacy notice</a>.
</p>

<h3>What if I want to change my signature?</h3>
<p>
  Use this link to change your signature:
  <a href="{{env.WEBSITE_URL}}/{{letter.slug}}?token={{signature.token}}">
    Edit Signature
  </a> (keep this email in case you want to modify your signature later, and don't share it with anyone).
</p>
</body>
</html>
